 team returns again. Without Soubi to help him fight, can Ritsuka make it out on his own?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8fQuVklJPeUxA2I8uszMl1q0Q7f.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2815","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"149","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"149","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"21998","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79031","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"27595","synopsis":"By the mystery of his brother’s death, and the existence of Soubi, Ritsuka was spending a night without sleeping. Then, another sacrifice and fighting machine came to him. They were Kinta and Gin. They showed him an envelope. They said there was what Ritsuka wanted to know inside. What's inside the envelope? Is it truely what Ritsuka wants to know?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rY32t79pphxsH61cHIEbYLwRrag.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"By the mystery of his brother’s death, and the existence of Soubi, Ritsuka was spending a night without sleeping. Then, another sacrifice and fighting machine came to him. They were Kinta and Gin. They showed him an envelope. They said there was what Ritsuka wanted to know inside. What's inside the envelope? Is it truely what Ritsuka wants to know?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rY32t79pphxsH61cHIEbYLwRrag.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2815","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"149","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"149","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"21998","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79031","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"27602","synopsis":"Ritsuka refuses to join any club activities because it clashes with his therapist’s appointments. While he worries ever more about forgetting his past, she offers to take him out for a “date” to get to know him a bit better, where he accidentally reveals the extent of his mother’s abuse of him. Meanwhile, Ritsuka’s teacher attempts to make another home visit, but gets accosted by the latest pair of enemies, codenamed “Zero” They take her captive and Soubi intervenes and takes them on without Ritsuka present as his sacrifice.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/igQfiVT5ZOTFuBOMC2SeeUhIEn.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Ritsuka refuses to join any club activities because it clashes with his therapist’s appointments. While he worries ever more about forgetting his past, she offers to take him out for a “date” to get to know him a bit better, where he accidentally reveals the extent of his mother’s abuse of him. Meanwhile, Ritsuka’s teacher attempts to make another home visit, but gets accosted by the latest pair of enemies, codenamed “Zero” They take her captive and Soubi intervenes and takes them on without Ritsuka present as his sacrifice.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/igQfiVT5ZOTFuBOMC2SeeUhIEn.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2815","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"149","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"149","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"21998","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79031","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"27597","synopsis":"Soubi's battel with the Zeros continue. But however, when it's finally over, he comes down with really serious injuries. Ritsuka grows suspicious of Soubi's constant lies, and finally decides to do something about them. Meanwhile, Shinonome is still haunted by Soubi's words to her.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/b8Y7RP1AbuwaxrX892vSjkFR3Aq.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Soubi's battel with the Zeros continue. But however, when it's finally over, he comes down with really serious injuries. Ritsuka grows suspicious of Soubi's constant lies, and finally decides to do something about them. Meanwhile, Shinonome is still haunted by Soubi's words to her.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/b8Y7RP1AbuwaxrX892vSjkFR3Aq.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2815","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"149","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"149","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"21998","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79031","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"27600","synopsis":"A new Zero is in town. In order to keep Ritsuka out of danger once again, Soubi fights the team alone. But this time, he's probably met his match. Ritsuka, felling that there's something Soubi's hiding from him, attempts to find him. Can he make it in time?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8NFWhhyBHCZOfmtzcviTy6VY1Is.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"A new Zero is in town. In order to keep Ritsuka out of danger once again, Soubi fights the team alone. But this time, he's probably met his match. Ritsuka, felling that there's something Soubi's hiding from him, attempts to find him. Can he make it in time?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8NFWhhyBHCZOfmtz